{"type":"text","timestamp":1791634550133,"sessionID":"ses_eda43d32bffehZumb2jEv7Tiam","part":{"id":"prt_125bda71c0019Pb7ReKwxLbt78","messageID":"msg_125bda153001bEwNOBgXdVGQdT","sessionID":"ses_eda43d32bffehZumb2jEv7Tiam","type":"text","text":"Done. All tasks implemented and committed on `feature/medical_policies` (branch matches the brief), working tree clean.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded the new top-level `policies/` catalog directory with short, universal, always-on policy files — plain markdown, no frontmatter, one rule per file.\n\n**Final set (4 files):**\n- `policies/secrets-hygiene.md`\n- `policies/no-debug-leftovers.md`\n- `policies/ask-before-adding-dependencies.md`\n- `policies/keep-it-committed.md`\n\n**TASK-6 audit outcome — dropped `smallest-change`:** every other proposed rule only existed as a role-specific or on-demand instruction (`agents/security.md`, `agents/quality.md`, `agents/developer.md`), so promoting it to a global policy added real scope. `smallest-change` did not: `prompts/meta.md`, the system-wide layer already in every session, states \"Prefer small, focused… changes… never silently expand a task\" and \"Don't do things you're not asked to do.\" Per criterion 3, a rule that rules a *already-global* instruction with no added scope was removed. The brief and tasks explicitly anticipated a final set smaller than five.\n\n**Commits (one per task, then the summary):** `0c6737e`, `6b6002b`, `26a6159`, `172df01`, `7e415ae`, `cd9f132`, `74d0beb`.\n\n**Verification:** no build/test tooling exists in this repo, so verification was content review against the brief's criteria. Confirmed no frontmatter, no README, no hidden files, and no symlinks in `policies/` (the catalog scan's exclusions).\n\nOne caveat recorded in `implementation.md`: the dedupe check was limited to the content present in this checkout — manigot's `internal/session/policies.go`, its `AGENTS.md`, and the \"~70 more\" skills referenced by the brief are not here, so those should be re-checked later for overlap.","time":{"start":1791634548508,"end":1791634550129}}}
